// # General Matrix Multiply (GEMM) & Batched Operations Engine
//
// Logline: Implements 2D GEMM matrix multiplication (C = A * B) and Batched Matrix Multiplication (BMM).
//
// Setup: Pure numerical algebra engine executing cache-friendly matrix dot products and tensor contractions.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Validate 2D matrix inner dimension compatibility (M x K) * (K x N) -> (M x N).
//   2. Execute cache-blocked 2D matrix multiplication.
//   3. Compute Batched Matrix Multiplication across batch dimensions [B, M, K] x [B, K, N].
//   4. Compute 1D vector dot products.

import "std/tensor/tensor.oo";

/// 2D Matrix Multiplication wrapper delegating to core engine.
pub fn tensor_gemm_2d(a: &Tensor, b: &Tensor) -> Result[Tensor, String] { return tensor_matmul_2d(a, b); }
